            "text": "def seriesLeg : Phase α → ℂ := fun p => if 0 ≤ x i then\n    ∑ a ∈ Finset.range (x i).natAbs, mode p (update x i (a:ℤ)) else\n    - ∑ a ∈ Finset.range (x i).natAbs, mode p (update x i (-(a+1:ℤ)))",
